flowchart TD
    Start([Caller connects<br/>ConversationRelay WebSocket opens])
    Setup[voiceChannel setup event<br/>captures CallSid, customParameters,<br/>welcomeGreeting]
    FirstMsg[First caller utterance arrives<br/>onMessageReady → handleMessage]
    HandleMsg{Takeback?<br/>customParameters.takeback === 'true'}
    IntentDet[INTENT_DETECTION agent<br/>strict classifier — outputs ONE of<br/>NEW_LEAD / EXISTING_QUOTE_OR_TRIP /<br/>IN_DESTINATION / GENERAL_INQUIRY / UNKNOWN]
    IntentSwitch{Which category?}

    NewLead[NEW_LEAD agent<br/>collect trip details,<br/>lookup advisor, handoff]
    Existing[EXISTING_QUOTE_OR_TRIP agent<br/>collect quote/trip ref,<br/>handoff to specialist]
    InDest[IN_DESTINATION agent<br/>gather trip context,<br/>handoff to on-trip support]
    General[GENERAL_INQUIRY agent<br/>collect basics,<br/>handoff to reception]
    Stack[STACK_CALL agent<br/>callback recovery flow —<br/>see detailed diagram]
    Unknown[UNKNOWN agent<br/>attempt disambiguation,<br/>end_call if stuck]

    Start --> Setup
    Setup --> FirstMsg
    FirstMsg --> HandleMsg
    HandleMsg -->|yes| Stack
    HandleMsg -->|no| IntentDet
    IntentDet --> IntentSwitch
    IntentSwitch -->|NEW_LEAD| NewLead
    IntentSwitch -->|EXISTING_QUOTE_OR_TRIP| Existing
    IntentSwitch -->|IN_DESTINATION| InDest
    IntentSwitch -->|GENERAL_INQUIRY| General
    IntentSwitch -->|UNKNOWN| Unknown

    NewLead -.->|caller wants<br/>something else| ChangeIntent[CHANGE_INTENT<br/>reset to INTENT_DETECTION]
    Existing -.->|caller wants<br/>something else| ChangeIntent
    InDest -.->|caller wants<br/>something else| ChangeIntent
    General -.->|caller wants<br/>something else| ChangeIntent
    Stack -.->|caller wants<br/>something else| ChangeIntent
    ChangeIntent --> IntentDet

    classDef start fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0369a1,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef control fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#000
    classDef agent fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#000
    classDef stack fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#000
    classDef change fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#000

    class Start,Setup,FirstMsg start
    class HandleMsg,IntentSwitch,IntentDet control
    class NewLead,Existing,InDest,General,Unknown agent
    class Stack stack
    class ChangeIntent change
